        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Xeno's Adventure is a run and gun action game with focus on boss fights and harder difficulty. You will explore different worlds, battle mind controlled monsters and bosses, all in a drawn 2D Pixel Art style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Xeno as you traverse different worlds, upgrade your stats, learn powerful skills, while you try to save all worlds from the antagonist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Xeno's Adventure includes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Worlds to explore</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 Platformer Levels </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >14 Bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Shops (Unlock Skills, Upgrade Skills &amp; Upgrade your Character's Stats)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 60 different monsters (4 different types of enemies for example &quot;Range Attack Enemy&quot;)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on the skill of the player, it will take you 6 to 14 hours of playtime, to finish the game.</p>",
